Third-party components
----------------------

Microsoft MarkItDown
    https://github.com/microsoft/markitdown
    MIT License, Copyright (c) Microsoft Corporation.

    This plugin does not bundle, vendor, or modify MarkItDown. It locates an
    installation the user already has -- Microsoft's `markitdown` command,
    `uvx markitdown`, or `python -m markitdown` -- and invokes it as a separate
    process. When no installation is present it uses its own built-in
    converter and never downloads MarkItDown on its own.

